  "description": "CsvHelper support for AdCodicem value objects: each value object a single column, written as its own text, which its parser reads back, and read through its rules, a refused field throwing CsvHelper's TypeConverterException with the rule's code in its Data, an empty field refused as required unless the member is nullable, and an uninitialized instance its rules refuse never written. AOT-compatible code; CsvHelper's record API itself does not run natively.",
